\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Supervised baselines against the LLM pipelines, macro-F1, balanced pools and 10$\times $ and 100$\times $ long-tailed pools of 1,600 training examples. Supervised rows are means over three seeds, pipeline rows over six models and three seeds. The best pipeline is selected on the test set. LR: MiniLM with logistic regression. RoB$_{\mathrm  {B}}$ and RoB$_{\mathrm  {L}}$: fine-tuned RoBERTa-base and RoBERTa-large. FS and CICLe: few-shot and CICLe with Per-Class retrieval at $k = 4$ (F: Fixed retrieval on Ohsumed). Bold marks the best value per row. Full version in Table~\ref {tab:baselines}.}}{8}{table.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
